==Patch History==
{{Scrollbox/Article|
{{ver|38.6}}
*Fixed performance issues caused by Kuva Ogris’ SFX while Adhesive Blast is equipped.

{{ver|26}}
*Now an Exilus Weapon mod.

{{ver|19.10}}
*Fixed Adhesive Blast's unintentional ability to cause stuck projectiles to deal damage over time and [[Proc]] [[Status Effect]]s.

{{ver|19.13.1}}
*Fixed Adhesive Blast not causing the Javlok explosion to stick and pause for a while (through primary fire).

{{ver|19.0.4}}
*Fixed the 'Adhesive Blast' Mod not working on the Zarr.

{{ver|17.10}}
*The Adhesive Blast Mod’s description has been altered to reflect its function. The mod now states there is a 100% sticky chance at Max Rank, and ranking this mod will be required to achieve this.

{{ver|17.2.1}}
*Fixed a bug where the Adhesive Blast mod would cause Ogris missiles to pass through enemies, doors, loot-crates etc.

{{ver|17.0.4}}
*Fixed the Ogris’ rockets not exploding properly when used with the Adhesive blast Mod.

{{ver|17}}
*Introduced.
